{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, then approach, grab, check, move, place and execute task. Else, scan or roam. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = RoamAround    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Action ID = PlaceObject    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
